WEBVTT

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:25.840
Saint Seiya

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.170
The Underworld.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.320
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:45.300
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:49.050
They are at the mercy of destiny.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.180
Rising Dragon Punch!

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:56.090
Diamond Dust!

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:08.530
Lord Hades prepared a
despondent fate for earth.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:15.960
The Greatest Eclipse. The eternal eclipse.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.940
All creatures of Earth will perish.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:22.960
It will turn into a dark, cold world.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.730
Who are you?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.670
Grand Master Libra Dohko.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.870
Grand Master? Libra Dohko?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.890
All of you!

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:51.390
Mu. Aioria. Miro.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:59.920
The three who saved me with
their Cosmo are still alive!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.860
It is all due to Athena.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.550
Athena?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:11.690
Yes, apparently there's
still work left to be done.

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:19.510
Shaka, I am returning the 108 bead
rosary I was holding for you.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.750
Mu.

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:25.030
Look at the beads that have changed color.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:30.360
You can die after changing
the color of all the beads.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:41.490
But without sunlight, we
cannot pass the Wailing Wall.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:46.490
We can't go after Athena
who is beyond this wall.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.870
Sunlight?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:58.010
Reunion: The Gold Cloths

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:03.970
We have no time to waste as Hades has

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.020
begun the Greatest Eclipse.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:12.240
So I must do what I can.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.630
We can break it.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.700
We can break through the Wailing Wall.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.530
The Wailing Wall?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.160
You can break through it?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.910
Yes.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:31.120
By combining the powers of the Gold Saints,
it is possible to create sunlight.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.220
By combining our powers...

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.130
And create sunlight?

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.990
Grand Master, what do you mean?

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:48.640
Have you forgotten where the
Gold Saint constellations shine?

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:55.070
Right, the Gold Saint constellations
are on the ecliptic.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.950
The ecliptic is the path the
sun moves along in one year.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:04.700
The twelve Gold Cloth constellations
are on the path of the sun.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:10.100
They have been absorbing the power
of the sun since ancient times.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:17.290
It means that for every Gold Cloth,
there is sunlight accumulated within it.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.640
Right.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.760
Which means, Grand Master...

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.470
That's right.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:32.920
If we, with the power of the sun, ignite
our Cosmo and crash into the wall,

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:48.660
we will definitely be able
to destroy the Wailing Wall!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.890
For the first time...

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.090
For the first time the Gold Saints

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:02.400
have taken hold of the Libra weapons!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.970
We'll destroy the Wailing Wall!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:09.010
To defeat Hades!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.390
To protect Athena.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.650
To stop the Greatest Eclipse.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.850
And to protect peace on Earth.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:26.780
We shall become sunlight!

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:28.970
Let's go!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.700
Ignite your Cosmo to the fullest.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.050
Awaken your Eighth Sense!

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:37.000
We will unite our lives into one.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.470
In these depths of hell.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.030
Let there be light!

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.810
Is that...

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.970
This light...

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.030
This light, could it be?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:07.530
Are the Saints trying to break down
the Wailing Wall to go after Hades?

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.730
It's futile, though.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:14.910
Even the Gold Saints can't
break through that wall.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.490
Never.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.050
Will the Wailing Wall break?

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.100
Seiya!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:28.510
What?

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.080
Aioria.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.220
Mu, Miro!

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.720
Grand Master.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.240
How could it be?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:55.000
How could the Wailing Wall be this strong?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.080
How could it be?

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:01.300
Five Gold Saints combined their forces.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.730
We were armed with the Libra weapons.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.710
And we still couldn't even
make a scratch in the wall.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:13.000
If only all twelve Gold Saints were here.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.750
Is there no other way to proceed?

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:24.490
To meet Miss Saori, Athena,
on the other side of the wall?

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:29.410
If we don't stop the Greatest Eclipse,

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.660
we will all be veiled in darkness.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.060
The world will end.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.050
Eclipse.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:45.040
However, at a time like this, it's ominous.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:51.520
It feels like we'll never see the sun again.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:55.480
You guys shouldn't run your mouths like that.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.510
Shina.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.940
Seiya and the others are fighting
to the death in the Underworld.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:08.210
Stop being cowards. Our duty
is to guard the Sanctuary.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.940
Yes, why of course.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:11.860
But, Shina,

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:18.250
in the worst case, we may
never see the sun again.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.830
What do you mean?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:24.900
Marin, where were you during this emergency?

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:32.120
Don't be mad, Shina. There's something
strange about this eclipse.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:33.170
What?

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:38.200
It is said Hades hates
sunlight more than anything.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:42.080
This might be a reason.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:46.840
Could it be? Then we would all be in trouble.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.820
Everyone! Listen!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.950
Everyone, there's trouble!

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:52.700
Kiki.

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:54.890
What's going on, Kiki?

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:59.870
This eclipse is happening
simultaneously all around the world.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.110
What?

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.460
Nonsense.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.830
That's impossible.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:09.080
So it is the Greatest Eclipse.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:16.470
If this continues, the world
will be engulfed in darkness.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.140
Seiya.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.490
Damn it! We can't give up against a wall.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.460
Seiya.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.650
Grand Master, let us try this time.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.020
It's no use.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:43.610
As Shaka said, if this wall is
what divides hell and Elysion,

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:48.420
then the strength of
mortals may not be enough.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:54.080
No, if we have the power of the
Gold Cloths, we can destroy it.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:59.810
We were even able to destroy
the Main Breadwinner.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:14.850
Grand Master, let me use the Libra weapon.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.820
You mustn't. Stop it, Seiya.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.110
Seiya.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.330
Seiya.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.300
Burn.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:32.360
Burn, Cosmo. Awaken my Eighth Sense!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:33.780
Seiya.

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:37.960
Shun, I'm leaving Miss Saori up to you.

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.260
Seiya.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:45.190
If you happen to meet my sister,

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:47.560
tell her that I'm sorry
I wasn't able to see her.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:48.780
Seiya!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:56.980
For the world, for Athena, ignite
to your brightest, my Cosmo!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.000
Seiya!

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.660
What the...

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.250
What's that?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:09.700
What?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.660
But why here?

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.470
What is it?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:24.570
A meteor just flew out
of the Sagittarius house.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.890
I saw it with my very own eyes.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.350
Look, Shina.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.290
What's that?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.160
It's not just from the Sagittarius house.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.870
The Aquarius house, Capricorn house.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:41.900
Taurus house.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.560
Even the Cancer house.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.170
And from the Pisces house.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:51.520
There's no mistake. Those lights

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.080
are Gold Cloths!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:59.500
The souls of the fallen Gold Saints

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:03.020
are all headed to the Underworld.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:12.900
Please, Aioros. Help Seiya and the others.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:19.130
There are those who await
their return on Earth.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:23.260
And those who long for a reunion.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.640
We're finally here.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:27.990
The Eighth Prison.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.580
I can't sense the presence of the Specters.

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:36.190
Seiya and Grand Master must
have infiltrated the Giudecca.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.530
Let's hurry, Shiryu.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.470
Hyoga, what's that?

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:43.950
What're those lights?

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:53.140
Those divine lights.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:58.050
Why is the Sagittarius Gold Cloth here?

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:02.510
What? It came to the Underworld?

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.220
It can't be.

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:07.430
To rescue us?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.190
Aioros.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:10.650
Brother.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.710
More lights.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:16.680
What's that?

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:19.610
The Aquarius Gold Cloth.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.380
Even the soul of Camus.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.910
And now the Capricorn Gold Cloth.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:28.970
Shura?

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.920
The Taurus Gold Cloth.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.160
Aldebaran.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.000
Even the Cancer and Pisces Gold Cloths.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.140
Deathmask.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.370
Aphrodite.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:56.320
The Gold Cloths of the fallen Gold
Saints have appeared in the Underworld.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.470
Six Gold Cloths.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:04.980
And my Libra Gold Cloth.
The Virgo Gold Cloth.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.060
The Leo Gold Cloth.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.020
The Scorpio Gold Cloth.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.950
The Aries Gold Cloth.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:18.430
Eleven Gold Cloths have
gathered in the Underworld.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.550
And the remaining Gold Cloth?

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.160
Is Canon's.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.620
What?

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.670
The Gold Cloths!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.120
What's this sound?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.130
It's the Gold Cloths?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:49.050
The Gold Cloths are reacting to one another.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.020
This reaction...

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:02.230
The other Gold Cloths are
calling the Gemini Gold Cloth.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:09.470
However, this reaction is in desperation.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:16.410
Unfortunately, I can't let you go, Canon.

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:21.620
Isn't it about time you
realized, Rhadamanthys?

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:23.210
What?

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:28.990
That the defeat of the
Underworld is imminent.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.380
What?

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.490
You abandoned your Cloth.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.150
What are you trying to do?

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:49.990
I don't need it anymore. I'm
returning it to my brother.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:51.450
What?

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.780
Now go, Gemini!

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.740
Fly to the other Gold Cloths!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.720
Farewell, Gemini.

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:04.560
I'm leaving the rest to you, Saga.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.710
Now, my job is done.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:15.720
I'll be your opponent to your
heart's content, Rhadamanthys.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.620
What are you scheming, you bastard?

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:23.690
I told you, I just returned the
Gemini Cloth to its rightful owner.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:29.270
Do you intend to fight me without a Cloth?

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.730
Don't underestimate one of
the Underworld's Big Three!

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.110
Greatest Caution!

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:50.000
What's wrong? I thought the same
move didn't work twice on a Saint.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.930
Demon Emperor Delusional Attack!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.410
That's pathetic.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.400
Is it because you took off the Cloth?

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:05.170
Or the wounds you received
from Aiacos haven't healed?

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.690
This isn't satisfying, Canon!

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.740
This isn't the fight I was seeking.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:20.490
I wanted you to come at me
with everything you've got.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.160
You're softer than I thought, Rhadamanthys.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:26.700
What?

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.990
Fine. I will grant you your wish!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:30.630
Fool!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:36.590
Do you think you can defeat me without
your Cloth in your condition?

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:41.240
This is it, Canon!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.430
Greatest...

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.290
Bastard.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.830
You're coming with me, Rhadamanthys.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.530
We'll die together!

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.770
Ridiculous! A man like you wouldn't
drag another man down with you.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:57.980
Are you crazy?

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:00.520
I told you my job is done.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:05.540
The twelve ultimate warriors
have gathered at the Giudecca.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.790
What?

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.850
Now victory is imminent.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:15.460
I have atoned for all my
sins and have no regrets.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:21.560
Now, let's take the Galaxian
Explosion together, Rhadamanthys!

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.430
Stop, Canon!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:28.660
Let's feel the power of planets exploding!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:29.490
What's this?

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:34.560
Galaxian Greatest Explosion!

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.050
Athena.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.440
Brother.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.220
Shiryu, this Cosmo.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.160
Canon.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.050
That meteor.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.470
That was Canon's.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:06.510
The Gemini Gold Cloth.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.850
The Gemini Gold Cloth headed to the Giudecca.

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:15.240
Let's hurry, Shiryu.

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.800
What's at the end of these stairs?

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:39.130
What's that light?

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.560
The Gemini Gold Cloth.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.300
It's not just that.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:50.310
There are other Gold Cloths.
Even my master Camus'.

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:52.720
The Aquarius Cloth is there too.

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:55.280
Even Shura's Capricorn Cloth.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.440
They've finally come together.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.830
All twelve Gold Cloths.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.560
Seiya, Shun!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.490
Shiryu.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.130
Hyoga!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:18.740
Grand Master? What's going on, Grand Master?

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:22.260
Why have all the Gold Cloths gathered here?

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:26.770
Even the ones without their owners
are here in the Underworld.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:33.060
It's all for Athena, and
to summon sunlight to hell.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.390
Sunlight?

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:36.570
Summon?

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:42.610
Shiryu, Hyoga. Athena has chased
after Hades beyond this wall.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:44.500
What?

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.630
Athena?

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:48.780
That's why we have gathered.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.200
To create sunlight and destroy the Wailing
Wall that blocks the way to Elysion.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:59.260
I think I finally understand.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:04.170
We were born for this moment.

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:06.970
To open the way to the future.

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:10.390
What? The Gold Cloths!

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:11.920
They are glowing again!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:15.170
They shine so radiantly.

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:16.440
What's going on?

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:22.340
What's this?

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:24.870
Could it be?

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:26.640
Is this...

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:07.280
The Wailing Wall... When despair takes over,

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:10.640
the twelve golden Cosmos
open the way to Elysion.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:15.040
Leaving the Saints in charge of
the love and justice of Earth...

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:19.110
Gold Saints! We will deliver
Athena's Cloth without fail!

00:24:19.270 --> 00:24:22.970
And defeat Hades by our own hands!

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:26.360
Saint Seiya: "Farewell Gold Saints."

00:24:26.580 --> 00:24:30.080
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
